        "description": "Keep one of my lists filled from a JSON, RSS or Atom feed, leaving edits intact unless update_existing is requested. Reads candidate row ids, keeps media in Files, and can stamp a successful run. Shared-library input is available only to hosts supplying its admitted library owner.",
